  "details": "### Vulnerability Condition: Broken Object Level Authorization (BOLA)\n\n**Category**: Cross-Tenant Authorization\n**CWE**: CWE-639\n**Target Tool**: `get_customer`\n\n#### Vulnerable Behavior\nExecutes findOne({customer_id}) without scoping to session tenant_id.\n\n#### Secure Mitigation\nEnforces compound query filter {customer_id, tenant_id}.\n\n#### Description\nMissing tenant scoping on direct identifier lookups in get_customer.",
